---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Terms"
  description="Terms for using the Jathin Gold website and selling metal at the Kothagudem desk."
  path="/terms"
>
  <div class="wrap page-head">
    <h1>Terms</h1>
  </div>
  <section class="band band-ticket">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>Rates on this website are indicative market figures. They are not an offer. A sale exists only when you accept a written quote after testing and complete KYC.</p>
      <p>Jathin Gold buys gold, silver, and platinum. It does not sell jewellery, coins, or bars to the public on this site.</p>
      <p>Cash on a single sale will not exceed ₹2,00,000. We do not buy anonymously.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
